{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_035_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:758e85f8a7f4cbf34268b0e86f30fa0631a03d69747f536b01c2993ecc03c2a7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_035_22:5_02_035_22_a:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85943a014645f133e4d813b9bd1b4746d38a585d75a27d13274637489a7c0cd5",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，方便占用一点时间吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_035_22:5_02_035_22_a:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b7ce5cbe3aeb094f555cca0a1007eb32a9cf9d4e6cfee6478500fafde4312f4",
      "text": "今天想必是白色情人节吧。\n我为你准备了回礼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_035_22:5_02_035_22_a:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c59c7e87f0bc2ce2f351bcaf2baed578dbd18cc13eadd5ef11018c3257ec7055",
      "text": "虽然情人节普遍以赠送巧克力\n为主流……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_035_22:5_02_035_22_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cdb70cb1e7b90744b044e1a32a06159a15a77599beb9373cb61d1a0c9785a62b",
      "text": "但白色情人节似乎会根据赠送物品的不同，\n所传达的含义也有所变化。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_035_22:5_02_035_22_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aaaa7cc26550c8d1cbf8b0a8339ffc7e4c90481deaf9d7274c575d337984b0db",
      "text": "我以自己的方式，挑选了能将对你的心意传达出的\n礼物。请收下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_035_22:5_02_035_22_b:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0267d2f947e4e3518c05a07d53366a4a93956a26b357fb1fe2ce21022df165c9",
      "text": "辛苦了，●●●●プロデューサー。\n我有东西想交给你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_035_22:5_02_035_22_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d600f7f2c12fa3ddd145797d0ce9c2a4c6f590f9d9e53a4c20d3a3f7049f3d42",
      "text": "这是白色情人节的谢礼。\n还请收下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_035_22:5_02_035_22_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a0e8eb9f67767170f3c16f9ea7679dd958f6b39dbe0c48a0458ce0c9b892a246",
      "text": "列举送礼的候选方案虽然轻而易举，\n但要精简筛选却颇费了一番思量。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_035_22:5_02_035_22_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0dd3fd5b0a34610c8c29d0e6283894bdff65d4875a6e3254afa40100e34335c2",
      "text": "结合事先收集的数据反复推敲思考后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_035_22:5_02_035_22_b:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f3b4c287c7cbbbc1ddbfbd36ee9f7db3f820db2d7c9bcb0bdb6692f74839443",
      "text": "最终判定，若是此物应当能令你\n感到喜悦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_035_22:5_02_035_22_b:cmd-000032:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4168d4eb0a3737e8008752586fb97901e9fa29391625891ec53a40530407324f",
      "text": "光是这份心意就足够让我高兴了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_035_22:5_02_035_22_b:cmd-000033:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ccb914c1968a0768da834c6b4ea69b7f2f0c765aaa81d4e6c64126d995d67f7f",
      "text": "非常感谢！好开心",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_035_22:5_02_035_22_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4ed7c8c8f699daa0947400dccbabb6426e1da4323d2eb18f8ce820707139676",
      "text": "是吗。\n你能这么想就比什么都好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_035_22:5_02_035_22_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6571f8d05aefc708db885f011c17c2999b4eec8ecce8886aa4658c2545e0dcae",
      "text": "里面的东西之后请静下心来慢慢过目。\n那么，失陪了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
